# per-run gate results: every run rewrites them (~5,600 changed lines per gate
# commit). They stay on disk for the grader; the tracked comparison artefact is
# tasks/answer_bench/GATE_SUMMARY.json (counts by blocker, bucket, sector, family).
tasks/answer_bench/GATE_RESULTS_*.jsonl
tasks/pilot60/RESULTS_HAND60*.jsonl

# generated worker context pack (build_worker_context.py). Regenerated per checkout;
# a worktree worker is pointed at the MAIN checkout's pack by absolute path, so
# nothing needs the file in git and a merge no longer has to commit it first.
tasks/worker_context/CONTEXT.md
tasks/worker_context/schemas/

